   * the island's height budget: at 375px the 167px ramp made its title 130px
   * tall, and at 1280×720 the 198px ramp kept the final ticks below the fold.
   * The drawing still uses the same height-derived width, while its explanatory
   * scale may now use the available 330px track. At 1440×900 the drawing stops
   * at the existing 260px county-label collision floor so the complete legend
   * remains in view without changing the projection or any mark.
